node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# supabase/production-only-migrations/ holds SQL already applied to
# production exactly once. Most of it is real customer/business data
# (client names, addresses, contacts, job records) recovered from
# production's own supabase_migrations.schema_migrations for historical
# reference only — never git-committed, never replayed anywhere.
# Regenerate on demand straight from production if ever genuinely needed
# (see supabase/migrations/MIGRATION_README.md for the exact method) —
# do not treat a local copy as the source of truth.
supabase/production-only-migrations/*
!supabase/production-only-migrations/20260911173353_restrict_staging_tables_to_service_role.sql
